# Conformance probe pack whose own field gives the key an inner `when … as`
# binds (spec 0.34 ruling 9), most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   byte 0      n
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-aswhen message
format     conformance-inner-asouter
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.n  8  uint
inner   conformance-inner-aswhen
